# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 2 of 2 (NewZones038, 2026-11-11). Hand-written from
# players' recordings (4-14 people per quest), with Forever's quest data for titles, levels and objectives.
# Order: Powderfuse Port (the neutral goblin port), its south and east coast, Sleebo's workshop, Sunnyglade
# (the Twilight cult's farm town) and back to Farholde Keep. Players leave the zone at about 40-41: our Stranglethorn
# Vale, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows guide (40-43) carries on from Theramore.
# Left out on purpose:
# - WANTED: Old Rot-Chum (95120): Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42): behind a group choice only.
# - Cut Off the Heads (95562): Chogg'Zac is an elite (level 41): behind a group choice only.
# - The Eastsea pirates' second wave (Unchecked Expansion 95122, A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs! 95123, See Ya,
#   Scallywags! 95165, Admiral Lamora 95124): levels 44-45, above this leg.
# - Terrors From the Deep (95260): it starts at an object no source names yet.
# - Not My Circus (95982), From Port to Port (95219): almost nobody recorded handing them in.
# - The Tanaris errands (I Know a Guy 95295, Shipping and Handling 95296): they end across the sea.

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip East along the coast road from Farholde Keep to Powderfuse Port, the goblins' harbour. Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall in the middle of the docks, Gray Dawnbright and Innkeeper Zizplink are at the inn, Fimbo Greasemitz cooks beside it, Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz and Argo Brinewhistle work the north pier.
  turnin 94928                          -- Friz Frazzlespark
  accept 95288                          -- Smuggler's Paradise
  accept 95293                          -- Smuggler's Special
  accept 95059                          -- Frazzlespark's Crate: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it
  turnin 95961                          -- Gray Dawnbright
  accept 95975                          -- Her World
  accept 95121                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz: A Taste of the Sea
  accept 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz: Saltwater Savages
  accept 95119                          -- Unfriendly Competition
  accept 95254 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn: Trapclaw

step The south coast
  tip South along the shore from the port: the saltwater murlocs camp on the beaches; the sand crawlers drop the meat.
  kill 256801 x8 quest 95118.1          -- Murloc Warrior
  kill 255898 x8 quest 95118.2          -- Murloc Oracle
  collect 268344 x12 quest 95121.1 @72.5,67.7  -- Saltwater Murloc Eye
  collect 268345 x6 quest 95121.2 @78.7,49.0  -- Sand Crawler Meat

step Old Rot-Chum
  when group 95120
  tip Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42) on the south shore: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95120 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn
  collect 268341 quest 95120.1 @77.6,72.0  -- Rot-Covered Harpoon
  turnin 95120                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz

step Trapclaw
  tip Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the port.
  collect 268586 quest 95254.1 @83.0,50.5  -- Trapclaw's Pincer

step The Eastsea pirates
  tip North-east along the coast to the pirates' camp on the cliffs. The buccaneers and musketeers carry the smuggled goods. Captain Bentcoin and Captain Haynes wait at the far end of the camp, by the water.
  kill 257901 x10 quest 95119.1         -- Eastsea Buccaneer
  kill 257910 x10 quest 95119.2         -- Eastsea Musketeer
  collect 268796 x8 quest 95288.1 @86.4,38.1  -- Smuggled Goods
  turnin 95293 @91.2,39.8               -- Captain Bentcoin
  accept 95294 @91.2,39.8               -- Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain

step Powderfuse Port
  turnin 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95119
  turnin 95254                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz
  turnin 95121
  turnin 95288                          -- Friz Frazzlespark
  turnin 95294

step Sleebo's workshop
  tip West up the road from the port: Sleebo Fizzlespout has his workshop on the hill.
  accept 96063                          -- Gaseous Gold
  accept 96067                          -- Rock 'em and Sock 'em
  complete 96067 @68.2,48.6             -- the stress test: fight G45-B4G beside the workshop

step The marsh
  tip South-west of the workshop the marsh bubbles with gas: fill the vials at the vents. The wildflowers grow in the meadows between the workshop and Terral's Watch.
  collect 272004 x8 quest 96063.1 @62.2,58.7  -- Marsh Gas Vial
  collect 271823 x20 quest 95975.1 @68.5,54.2  -- Wildflower

step Sleebo Fizzlespout
  turnin 96063
  turnin 96067

step Sunnyglade
  tip West past Rog'mar's south side to Sunnyglade, the farm town the Twilight cult holds. Apprentice Claire hides at its eastern edge, Fuzzle the kobold in the middle, and Farmer Elbrim at the farm to the north-east.
  accept 95642                          -- Apprentice Claire: Abominable Magics
  accept 95643                          -- Indiscriminate Purge
  accept 94961                          -- Fuzzle: Biting the Hand
  accept 94829                          -- Farmer Elbrim: What We Lost
  accept 94858                          -- All That's Left

step The Twilight cult
  tip The cultists fill the streets and fields of Sunnyglade. Fill Claire's catalyst at the ritual circles, bury the farmers' mementos in the loose soil, and pick up the doll and the locket in the burnt farmhouse. The Field Marshal's Log drops from the cultists: it starts a quest of its own.
  kill 256952 x8 quest 94877.1          -- Twilight Raider
  kill 254560 x8 quest 94877.2          -- Twilight Shadowmancer
  kill 256798 x8 quest 94877.3          -- Twilight Neophyte
  kill 261711 x5 quest 95643.1 @47.5,50.1  -- Empowered Brute
  kill 262169 x5 quest 95643.2 @47.7,49.7  -- Twilight Ritualist
  collect 266425 x25 quest 94881.1      -- Twilight Charm
  collect 266424 x5 quest 94879.1 @45.9,49.6  -- Twilight Page
  collect 267073 x20 quest 94961.1      -- Twilight Finger Bone
  complete 95642 @47.7,50.0             -- fill the Crystal Catalyst at the ritual circles
  complete 94829 @48.1,44.7             -- bury the mementos in the loose soil
  complete 94858 @53.6,44.9             -- the doll and the locket
  accept 94885                          -- Field Marshal's Log, from the cultists

step Apprentice Claire
  turnin 95642
  turnin 95643
  accept 94884                          -- An Unsettling Discovery: for Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep

step Cut Off the Heads
  when group 95562
  tip Chogg'Zac, the two-headed ogre, is an elite (level 41) at the western edge of Sunnyglade: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95562                          -- Apprentice Claire
  collect 265750 quest 95562.1 @44.8,51.2  -- Chogg's Head
  collect 265751 quest 95562.2 @44.8,51.2  -- Zac's Head
  turnin 95562

step Farmer Elbrim
  turnin 94829
  turnin 94858

step Fuzzle
  turnin 94961
  accept 94963                          -- Biting the Hand
  complete 94963 @41.6,47.7             -- lead Fuzzle out of Sunnyglade to his treasure, west of the town
  turnin 94963 @41.6,47.7               -- Fuzzle's Treasure

step Farholde Keep
  tip South-east back to Farholde Keep: a long walk down the road past Terral's Watch.
  turnin 95059                          -- Demar Brant
  turnin 94877
  turnin 94885
  turnin 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall
  turnin 94879
  turnin 94884
  turnin 95975                          -- Tessa Dawnbright, by the orchard

step On to Theramore
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore: fly from Gretchen Mayberry to Menethil Harbor and take the boat across, or hearth if you are bound in Theramore.
  goto 60.9,80.8 "Gretchen Mayberry, gryphon master"
